  "description": "研究完了扁平足，我最新结束的研究项目，就是罗圈腿了。",
  "body_html": "<p><span>研究完了扁平足，我最新结束的研究项目，就是罗圈腿了。</span></p><p><span>我们从小都被灌输这样的审美：笔直的腿。特别是年轻女性，几乎都希望有一双铅笔一样的腿，就像美少女战士里面的一样。</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg\" width=\"474\" height=\"264\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:264,&quot;width&quot;:474,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:39711,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/204215823?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tmhP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00fb97a1-3105-4595-a11c-0b801be2f951_474x264.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><span>从小医学就告诉我们，人的腿应该是直的。很多人检查身体的时候，医生都会跟他们说，你的腿不直，有点罗圈腿（bow leg）。</span></p><p><span>医生会跟他们说，两脚并在一起的时候，膝盖之间应该严丝合缝，没有任何缝隙。如果有缝隙，就是罗圈腿。他们甚至指定了具体的数字来衡量罗圈腿的严重程度。膝盖之间1-2厘米的间隙为“轻度罗圈腿”…… 如此等等。</span></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "研究完了扁平足，我最新结束的研究项目，就是罗圈腿了。",
